Z||000000||WisconsinGT||03-22-2000||08:27 AM||||Need to replace the bottom gasket on my 88GT's EGR Valve. After viewing the area, I noticed what looks to be a spacer and then another gasket. Are both gaskets the same? Also, do I need a a gasket where the EGR tube meets the EGR valve? Thanks||||reg||1
Z||000001||Luperman||03-22-2000||09:46 AM||||both gaskets are not the same and yes you need a gasket from the tube to the egr valve||||reg||6
Z||000002||wwh0001||03-22-2000||09:49 AM||||The gasket on top of the spacer and below the spacer are not the same. You can generally find the egr tube gasket and egr valve gasket at any auto parts store. I had to go to the dealor to get the gasket that is under the spacer.||||reg||1
